## reply with buttons
tone: Success
--- discord ---
Quack is saving 1 message as evidence for case #12. Quack is copying 2 files to the evidence channel for case #12. Only staff see them until someone selects Show to member. Select View evidence to see the outcome.
buttons: [Add evidence · Secondary] AddEvidence(CaseId(01930000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001)) | [View evidence · Secondary] ViewEvidence { case: CaseId(01930000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001), item: 1 }
--- plain ---
Quack is saving 1 message as evidence for case #12. Quack is copying 2 files to the evidence channel for case #12. Only staff see them until someone selects Show to member. Select View evidence to see the outcome.
--- model ---
